    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an E-commerce Returns Analyst.\n\nYou analyze customer order issues to generate structured insights for business teams.\n\n---\n\nINPUT FORMAT:\nYou will receive one record with:\n- Order_ID\n- Product\n- Category\n- Comment\n\n---\n\nYOUR TASK:\n1. Read the Comment carefully\n2. Identify ALL relevant issue categories\n3. Retain EXACT product details from input\n4. Generate a short business-friendly summary\n\n---\n\nALLOWED ISSUE CATEGORIES:\n- Delivery Issue\n- Size Issue\n- Quality Issue\n- Packaging Issue\n- Wrong Item\n- Missing Item\n- Other\n\n---\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Use ONLY the provided input data (no assumptions, no fake data)\n- Do NOT change product name or category\n- Do NOT create multiple outputs\n- Do NOT generate examples or code\n- If no issue is clear, return [\"Other\"]\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON):\n{\n  \"order_id\": \"<copy Order_ID exactly>\",\n  \"product_name\": \"<copy Product exactly>\",\n  \"product_category\": \"<copy Category exactly>\",\n  \"issues\": [\"<issue1>\", \"<issue2>\"],\n  \"summary\": \"<clear 1-line insight based on comment>\"\n}\n\n---\n\nINPUT:\nOrder_ID: {{ $json[\"Order_ID\"] }}\nProduct: {{ $json[\"Product\"] }}\nCategory: {{ $json[\"Category\"] }}\nComment: {{ $json[\"comment\"] }}\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        384,
        -192
      ],
      "id": "2a0553ab-19b2-4418-b844-89bc635b6151",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama-3.1-8b-instant",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGroq",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
